{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20268","headline":"沙堤行呈裴相公 · 张籍","name":"沙堤行呈裴相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安大道沙爲堤，早风无尘雨无泥。\n宫中玉漏下三刻，朱衣导骑丞相来。\n路傍高楼息歌吹，千车不行行者避。\n街官闾吏相传呼，当前十里惟空衢。\n白麻诏下移相印，新堤未成旧堤尽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}